- Constraints faithfully mirror the spec, including the frozen reason enum and explicit "do NOT commit".

## Summary
An exemplary, fully container-executable prompt: all DoD sections present, every code reference verified against source, failure modes and security concerns covered, and — critically — the inlined code, fixtures, and assertions were reproduced verbatim in temp copies and the resulting `bash scripts/test-sentry-read.sh` passed with `PASS: all AC1-AC6 assertions passed`. The only findings are quality-level: the new mixed-lineno precedence branch has no locking fixture (R1), the test's AC labels will be inconsistent with the retargeted spec header (R2), and the REVIEW NOTE hedge in requirement 1 should be resolved to a single decision (R3). Approve after addressing R1 (and optionally R2/R3).

